# The public site. Carried over from services#19. Its DNS record already
# resolves to this droplet (docs/published-content-root.md §1), so ACME HTTP-01
# reaches the origin and the certificate issues on the deploy that first carries
# the site block. This is the fourth HTTP-01 hostname on one Caddy, which is the
# growth the compose header above says should be reopened explicitly rather than
# drifted into.
