# of KNOXX_API_KEY_USER_EMAIL, which now names a non-human service identity
# that nobody reads mail for. Held as a secret, not a variable: this repo is
# public and Actions prints non-secret vars verbatim into run logs.
CADDY_ACME_EMAIL='${CADDY_ACME_EMAIL}'
